  "title": "Hyperbolic Vision-Language Models and Their Advances: UNCHA and Other Similar Work",
  "summary": "Both reports highlight advancements in hyperbolic vision-language models (VLMs) that enhance compositional understanding through uncertainty-guided alignment, with UNCHA addressing part-whole semantic representativeness. They emphasize improvements in hierarchical structure preservation and performance on zero-shot benchmarks.",
